## What this licence covers

The MIT licence above applies to the harness itself: Docker Compose, `bin/`,
`docker/`, `tests/`, docs, examples, and related project files authored here.

## Third-party components

### Vendored in this repository (GPL-2.0-or-later)

A curated subset of [WordPress/agent-skills](https://github.com/WordPress/agent-skills)
is committed under `.claude/skills/` and `.cursor/skills/`. Those trees keep
their upstream GPL-2.0-or-later licence (see `LICENSE` beside each skills root).
They are not MIT.

### Installed at setup or image build (not in git)

Pinned upstream releases, fetched when you run `./bin/setup` or build the
WordPress image. None of their source is committed here:

  WordPress                 GPL-2.0-or-later   https://wordpress.org
  MCP Adapter               GPL-2.0-or-later   https://github.com/WordPress/mcp-adapter
  MS WordPress Abilities    GPL-2.0-or-later   https://github.com/miriamschwab/ms-wp-abilities
  Twenty Twenty-Five        GPL-2.0-or-later   https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentyfive/
  WP-CLI                    MIT                https://wp-cli.org
  wp-cli/ability-command    MIT                https://github.com/wp-cli/ability-command

Each remains under its own licence.
